WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.410
Sam's classmate Lucía
sends him three texts.

2
00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.910
Acabo de llegar.

3
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.310
Sigo estudiando.

4
00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.750
Estudio español desde hace tres años.

5
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.290
Sam spots verbs he knows: "to
finish", "to follow", "to study".

6
00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.570
But "I finish arriving"?

7
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.697
"I follow studying"?

8
00:00:17.747 --> 00:00:19.910
That can't be right.

9
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.690
So what is Lucía really telling him?

10
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.990
In this mission, you'll meet
three phrases that don't translate

11
00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.370
word for word.

12
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:31.370
First: acabar de, plus an infinitive.

13
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.650
Next: seguir, plus a gerund,
with its stem change.

14
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:39.690
Last: desde hace, and the
tense that goes with it.

15
00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:43.690
Your mission: decode all
three of Lucía's texts.
